     "updated": "2010-08-07T07:32:02.602-0300"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:c66c0ca1-d216-410a-bd56-c26e320ea790",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ee73214c665b0206432c574576d17092?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ee73214c665b0206432c574576d17092?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ee73214c665b0206432c574576d17092?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ee73214c665b0206432c574576d17092?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Asger Askov Blekinge",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ac66c0ca1-d216-410a-bd56-c26e320ea790",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "No, we do not need a third way of expressing the type of an object. #hasModel is the way to express the class of an object. Yes, you can use rdf:type. And yes, you can use dc. But these are non-standard in a fedora context.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "About collection objects. No, let's not go there. We should not add a \"Collection\" content model. There are numerous reasons why this would be a bad idea. And without a specific content models, we should not add a \"isPartOfCollection\" relation to the ontology",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
